' Design pattern — Unit of Work.
'
' A sequence diagram rather than a class diagram: what matters here is the
' ORDER of the calls and where the boundary opens and closes, and a class
' diagram of IUnitOfWork is four method names and no story.
'
' Drawn from SessionTerminationService, the real caller — two writes through
' two different repositories, one transaction over both.
'
' The failure branch is one `alt` and no more. Both branches spelled out in
' full doubled the height for a rule the caption states in a line.
@startuml
!include _style.puml
!include _pattern-style.puml
autonumber

participant "خدمة إنهاء\nالجلسة" as SVC
participant "IUnitOfWork" as UOW
participant "المستودعات" as REPO
database "قاعدة بيانات\nالخدمة" as DB

SVC -> UOW : BeginTransactionAsync
SVC -> REPO : تعليم الجلسة منتهية
SVC -> REPO : إضافة سجلّ الملخّص

alt نجاح
  SVC -> UOW : SaveChangesAsync
  SVC -> UOW : CommitAsync
  UOW -> DB : إيداع الكتابتين معًا
else فشل أيّ خطوة
  SVC -> UOW : RollbackAsync
  UOW -> DB : إلغاء الكتابتين معًا
end
@enduml
